  UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts:
  - name_: Angry Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 0
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - 'Your growl and a few choice words are directed at the man with the white,
      wispy beard on your right. He grumbles a bit, but you can''t tell whether it''s
      from your words or from his already stupored state. '
  - name_: Sad Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 1
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - A whimper escapes your mouth and echoes to the man with the wispy white beard
      on your right. He grumbles a bit, but you can't tell whether it's from your
      sobs or from his already stupored state. However, he flashes a softening glance
      in your direction. "Be strong. Or it will eat you alive."
  - name_: Fear Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 3
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - A scream escapes your mouth and echoes to the man with the wispy, white beard
      on your right. He grumbles a bit, but you can't tell whether it's from your
      fearful scream or from his already stupored state. However, he flashes a disappointing
      glance in your direction. "Don't cry. You failed too many times already."
  - name_: Joy Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 2
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - 'You let out an elated cheer towards the old man with the wispy, white beard
      on your right. he grumbles a bit, but you can''t tell whether it''s from your
      cheer or from his already stupored state. '
  - name_: Happy Arm
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 2
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 0
    displayTexts:
    - 'You extend a welcoming hand to the man with the wispy, white beard on your
      right. He looks at you dazedly. He spats at your hand, leaving a brownish gunk. '
  - name_: Observe
    UseEmotionKey: 0
    emotionKey: 2
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 4
    displayTexts:
    - 'The naked man on the right wall has a wispy, white beard. His skin is thickened
      and gaunt, pressed so tightly that it shows the clear contours of his ribs.
      He mutters to himself. You can see the deep scars strewn all over his body.
      He coughs so hoarsely that you know some infection is growing in his lungs. '
  - name_: Manipulate
    UseEmotionKey: 0
    emotionKey: 2
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 5
    displayTexts:
    - 'You seek any valuables on the old man ahead of you. You don''t see anything
      worth taking. '
